    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Feb 2023 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2月份的仪式感，差不多都是开工大吉和情人节给的；在这个节骨眼上，聊聊人生三大重要关口：洞房花烛的前奏----“爱”是怎么回事？！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>女性一定要结婚么？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>婚姻的甜蜜有哪些</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>有没有什么觉得婚后脑子进水的事情？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>“爱”可能不是三言两语就可以盘清楚的，是人生重要的长期合约。一起来聊聊，如何慎重的签订这份合约，并让它长期盈利吧😊</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果，你想要寻找一个树洞，聊聊人生、工作困惑；又或者是初入职场，对工作计划、复盘毫无思路；还有在单身万岁和找个队友搭伴过日子的选择，两难的境地下，都欢迎关注➕我们！</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>当然，你也可以加➕vx：Y2Y8_Z的小助理号</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>进入志同道合的：听友、他律、吐槽群，分享你希望我们讨论的话题❤️</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目出现的资料清单如下：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【书籍类】📚</span></p><span></span><p><span>👉《追寻生命的意义》: [奥地利] 维克多·弗兰克</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn..png!thumbnail"></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐类】🎵</span></p><span></span><p><span>👉</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=17662349&amp;userid=332855901" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=17662349&amp;userid=332855901"><span>《Have You Seen My Sister Evelyn?》: Evelyn Evelyn</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>👉</span><a href="https://music.163.com/song?id=1914856001&amp;userid=332855901" data-url="https://music.163.com/song?id=1914856001&amp;userid=332855901"><span>《City Of Stars》: 王ok</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>👉</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=423406843&amp;userid=332855901" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=423406843&amp;userid=332855901"><span>《明天的烦恼交给明天(A cappella)》: Mr. Miss / Vocal Booth人声乐团</span></a></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>内容节点：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">8:50</a>：引言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="685">11:25</a>：过年回谁家？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a>：为什么会有催婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a>：婚后的另一半相处方式有改变吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a>：婚姻中的给予与放弃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2890">48:10</a>：后悔过吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3175">52:55</a>：如何看待婚姻这场长期合约</span></p>]]></description>
